      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This bug still exists when using objects like trees in the Terrain Tool and then deleting them. The references to the trees' materials remain intact.\n\nRecreating the VRC_SceneDescriptor resolves this issue as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
